('b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000104', 2, 'In the equation N₂ + H₂ → NH₃, both nitrogen and hydrogen atoms are initially unbalanced.', 'True', 'False', 'True', 'Both elements must be balanced by adjusting coefficients.', true),
