('b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000104', 2, 'In the balanced equation 2C₂H₆ + 7O₂ → 4CO₂ + 6H₂O, there are 14 oxygen atoms on the reactant side.', 'True', 'False', 'True', 'Seven oxygen molecules contain 14 oxygen atoms.', true),
